      "Συστατικά": "Sodium Bicarbonate 67% w/w, Aqua, Glycerin, Sodium Lauryl Sulfate, Aroma, Xanthan Gum, Menthol, Cocamidopropyl Betaine, Sodium Fluoride, Sodium Saccharin, Anethole, Mentha Piperita Oil, Steviol Glycosides, Eucalyptus Globulus Oil, Limonene, Terpineol, Pinene, CI 77491.\nΠεριέχει Sodium Fluoride (Φθοριούχο Νάτριο) 0,31% w/w (1400 ppm Φθόριο). ROMD Conține fluorură de sodiu 0,31% w/w (1400 ppm fluor), bicarbonat de sodiu 67% w/w."
